https://github.com/heart-er/vue3-error-repo
@LinusBorg @yyx990803

I look into the code and find another problem.  see [sfc](https://sfc.vuejs.org/#)
```javascript
<script setup>
defineExpose({ foo: 123 })
(() => {
    console.log('----');
})();
</script>
```
in this case, the `expression` node  is not a defineExpose call([processDefineExpose ](https://github.com/vuejs/vue-next/blob/master/packages/compiler-sfc/src/compileScript.ts#L560) return false). see [AST ](https://astexplorer.net/#/gist/199aa8f180aab69d335b961c0b8e5b3b/6b647b6ab208280b892f669ed12d9a7cdd9fc148)
